[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 19082.39, "timestamp": "05:18:02", "text": "最近我感觉不太好，所以几乎是在做准备"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19085.55, "timestamp": "05:18:05", "text": "穿好衣服，上床睡觉吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19087.39, "timestamp": "05:18:07", "text": "很快。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19089.83, "timestamp": "05:18:09", "text": "是的。你好吗？哦，是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19092.39, "timestamp": "05:18:12", "text": "你确实对此作出了回应。是的。怎么会这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19094.35, "timestamp": "05:18:14", "text": "你找到我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19096.948, "timestamp": "05:18:16", "text": "今天？很少有人能找到我。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19097.948, "timestamp": "05:18:17", "text": "在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19106.75, "timestamp": "05:18:26", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19109.788, "timestamp": "05:18:29", "text": "呃，我为什么会发热？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19113.868, "timestamp": "05:18:33", "text": "早餐？是的。再见。你吃早餐"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19117.07, "timestamp": "05:18:37", "text": "4:00"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19119.15, "timestamp": "05:18:39", "text": "是。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19123.03, "timestamp": "05:18:43", "text": "嗯，等等。你住在日本吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19127.39, "timestamp": "05:18:47", "text": "时间？笨蛋，现在是7点。它即将……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19133.47, "timestamp": "05:18:53", "text": "嗯，现在是早上7点。不，是早上7点半。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19135.67, "timestamp": "05:18:55", "text": "日本。我的天哪，你已经……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19138.47, "timestamp": "05:18:58", "text": "练习日式风格。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 19139.948, "timestamp": "05:18:59", "text": "我试过了，而且"}]